Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is our turf!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:12.21,0:00:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any of those\Npirates tries to set foot
Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.57,0:00:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on these grounds tonight,\Nit'll be the last thing they do!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.57,0:00:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The honor of Galley-La\Ndepends on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.45,0:00:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is the back door covered?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.72,0:00:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got guys coverin'\Nthe entire perimeter
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.09,0:00:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of this place and then some.\NNobody's gettin' in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on pirates!\NI dare ya! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.02,0:00:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...they're all huge, and\Narmed, and angry.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.45,0:00:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.09,0:00:39.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys have a\Nreputation for being able
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.72,0:00:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to handle themselves\Nwhen push comes to shove.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna rush in
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.16,0:00:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and do anything\Nwe're gonna regret later.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.46,0:00:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if we\Ntry to barge in swingin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll just be\Naskin' for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh...?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.40,0:00:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, and we\Nwouldn't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:01:00.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Says the guy who charged-in\Nin broad daylight!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:00.17,0:01:03.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, don't take your\Neyes off of 'em, Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't want any kind of surprise down\Nthere.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.61,0:01:07.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.61,0:01:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything happens,\Nyou let us know.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.83,0:01:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. You got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.56,0:01:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we're gonna have a really long\Nnight ahead of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:14.35,0:01:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if we blow our opportunity,\Nit's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:16.82,0:01:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let our guard down,\Nno matter what happens.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.26,0:01:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we wanna know\Nthe truth about Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.29,0:01:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then it has to be\Ntonight, or never.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.16,0:01:31.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I gotta feeling we'll\Nbe talkin' to her real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:32.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Iceburg?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not to be rude,\Nbut do you mind stepping out
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.94,0:03:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the room for a moment?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.84,0:03:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.61,0:03:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.31,0:03:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fetch Paulie. I need\Nto have a word with him.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.87,0:03:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:51.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.91,0:03:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg needs to see you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.37,0:03:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I assume it's very important.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He asked for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.88,0:03:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. Specifically.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.12,0:04:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have some things\Nto take care of
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in my office if\Nanyone needs me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.93,0:04:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.43,0:04:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like\Nawfully strange timing
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.87,0:04:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for a one-on-one conversation.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in blazes could it be about?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.60,0:04:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's his will!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.40,0:04:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, what're\Nyou doin' out here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on in there and talk to him.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.77,0:04:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.73,0:04:24.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry... We can\Nstep away from the door
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you're concerned\Nabout privacy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.05,0:04:27.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.35,0:04:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,could he wanna talk\Nabout with Paulie?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.12,0:04:37.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is,\Nit's between them.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got enough to deal with.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we need to stay focused on our\Npirate problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.66,0:04:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, according to Kalifa,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.56,0:04:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's a small group with only\Nseven people on their crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ones to watch out\Nfor are Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.78,0:04:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate hunter Zoro\Nand Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.55,0:04:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't\Nunderestimate the girl
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.85,0:04:55.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,traveling along with\Nthem or that other guy
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with the long, round nose.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.86,0:05:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. There are those\Ntwo you just mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,along with two others.\NCoo-coo!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.73,0:05:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what those pirates are\Nafter.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.73,0:05:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They set foot on this property tonight,\Nthey're done for.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.87,0:05:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every single last one of\Nthem, got it? Coo-coo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Right!\N– Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.48,0:05:21.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.37,0:05:22.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I apologize for putting you
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.57,0:05:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in harm's way like this, Paulie.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.11,0:05:26.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this is a very grave matter
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.61,0:05:29.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I trust {\i1}you{\i0}\Ncan get it done.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.28,0:05:31.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I put my faith in you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.68,0:05:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I give you my word, sir.\NI swear. I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a good man.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well s'pose I should get on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.76,0:05:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.70,0:05:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coo coo.\NHe done talking with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hey listen guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.84,0:05:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. I gotta head out and\Ntake care of somethin' cool?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem, that'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.22,0:06:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The four of us will keep watch over things\Nhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.48,0:06:03.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.67,0:06:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just keep Iceburg safe you guys.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.22,0:06:18.58,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,When you leave here.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.62,0:06:21.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Go straight to my office\Nand move my desk.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.59,0:06:24.59,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to lift up the rug and look\Nunderneath it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.61,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a safe hidden there.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jackpot.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.28,0:06:32.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Once you find that,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.38,0:06:37.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,enter this combination.\NFirst, right to number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puru-puru. Puru-puru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:46.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chuk chuk.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.88,0:06:48.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.61,0:06:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, awaiting your signal.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will be very soon now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.55,0:06:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At that time, the four\Nof you are to carry out
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.52,0:06:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}your respective missions\Nwith ruthless efficiency.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.45,0:06:59.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a loyal\Nmember of CP9, you have my word.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.94,0:07:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, are you ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.21,0:07:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.42,0:07:13.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Something blew up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.69,0:07:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no! What\Nthe hell was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.76,0:07:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grab water, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.09,0:07:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got\Na man down over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure\Nthat fire doesn't spread
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the building!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.64,0:07:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys. They're shooting at us!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.85,0:07:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No man!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.79,0:07:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it was some kind of bomb!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.90,0:07:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone must have set it then!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry men!\NWe gotta put out this fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.09,0:07:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone!\NGive me a hand!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.11,0:07:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not too subtle,\Nbut it'll do. Let's move!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.22,0:07:51.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fire's in the\Nnorth corner of the first floor!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.89,0:07:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is anyone hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.99,0:07:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There've\Nbeen no pirates spotted yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone keep your\Neyes peeled for intruders!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay at your posts men!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.35,0:08:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get inside!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.19,0:08:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir! Iceburg, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just a bit shocked.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.97,0:08:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.10,0:08:14.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's that guy\Nin the costume! Get him!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.42,0:08:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,RAHH! I'll pound\Nin their faces!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.76,0:08:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got your back!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.39,0:08:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.06,0:08:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coo coo.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.17,0:08:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he goes! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got this clown!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.94,0:08:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's alone. Box him in!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! It's the end of the line!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.10,0:08:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's headed for the roof!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.24,0:09:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, ya\Nthought ya could get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't ya, punk?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.67,0:09:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take a\Nlot more than that to get by us.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.11,0:09:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You made a big mistake when you decided to\Nmess with Galley-La.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.01,0:09:18.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the beating of your life!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.21,0:09:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cause we're not gonna\Nshow any mercy, scumbag.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.42,0:09:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can come\Nat me with all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:27.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it still won't be enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.39,0:09:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got two over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're\Nheaded for the back door!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's try and corner them!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move, move! After them!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let\Nthose bastards get inside!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.54,0:09:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have the\Nfloor plan memorized.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.28,0:09:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that correct?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.92,0:09:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, they all seem pretty\Nworked up down there.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.09,0:10:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. There is definitely\Nsomething going on right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.76,0:10:06.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, then. When are\Nwe gonna make our move?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.23,0:10:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– That idiot! What about the plan?!\N– That idiot! What about the plan?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.73,0:10:19.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought we weren't\Ngonna rush into anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.52,0:10:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.58,0:10:24.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're going for the back door!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.82,0:10:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's head em off!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.62,0:10:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter\Nwhat, they can't get inside!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got alotta\Nnerve coming here.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After the crap you\Ntried to pull last night?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you guys are in
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.55,0:10:46.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for a world of hurt for\Nmessin' with Mr. Iceburg!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.34,0:10:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:51.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it up now,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.41,0:10:53.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we might just go easy on ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.41,0:10:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're surrounded!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.11,0:10:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.31,0:10:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We already\Nknow that it's not just the two
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of you guys in your\Nlittle pirate gang.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now where are the others?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's pullin' out a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.47,0:11:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! They're gone?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.51,0:11:35.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.65,0:11:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.42,0:11:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, that guy's a monster.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.48,0:11:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He flew. He was\Nflying through the air.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.45,0:11:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.55,0:11:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can fly?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.66,0:12:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiots.\NDo you not know when to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.53,0:12:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's jumping!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.46,0:12:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Moon Walk!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.26,0:12:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the?! He's really flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Thorny Road!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.02,0:12:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you\Nyou were bested, didn't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready! Here he comes!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna\Nland in the courtyard!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.39,0:12:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.76,0:12:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he goes! Get around him!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.48,0:12:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can trap him in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:42.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.35,0:12:49.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.09,0:12:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All this time it was\Nliterally right under our noses.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hand it over.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.59,0:13:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly\Nunderstand its importance.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.34,0:13:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you bastards?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.31,0:13:10.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where in the hell did you come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.63,0:13:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the shadows.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.24,0:13:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. From the\Ndarkest corners of existence
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.94,0:13:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we bring with us\Nthe light of justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.51,0:13:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are Cipher Pol No. 9, an\Nundercover intelligence agency.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.95,0:13:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter\Nwhere you freaks came from.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.22,0:13:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure as hell didn't\Nget in without running
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.12,0:13:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,into the Galley-La craftsmen.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.16,0:13:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:31.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The details\Nare all very hazy,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.91,0:13:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a sea of fists and bodies.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.71,0:13:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's important is we're here now.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.95,0:13:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.98,0:13:46.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't just some assassination plot,\Nis it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.49,0:13:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very astute.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.56,0:13:50.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But then, we never claimed\Nthat it was, now did we.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.39,0:13:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case we need what Iceburg\Nwas trying to keep hidden.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.43,0:13:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The item you hold in\Nyour trembling hand now.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.90,0:14:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And since you have been\Nmade aware of its existence.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to take\Nyour life, as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.42,0:14:08.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In trusting you to this task,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg has signed\Nyour death warrant.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's\Nthe word? Did you find 'em?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.57,0:14:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nu-uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.47,0:14:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of\Nthose guys anywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.57,0:14:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They get inside?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's men standin' guard
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.04,0:14:22.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at every single point of entry.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, there's\Nno way they got in.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.56,0:14:25.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.37,0:14:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then where the\Nhell did they go?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.33,0:14:27.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They couldn't've gotten far.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.87,0:14:29.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've gotta be\Nhiding somewhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Search the perimeter\None more time. Got it?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.91,0:14:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here. He's behind this wall.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right. Now give me a push.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.93,0:14:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incredible. I had a feeling that\Nyou'd be coming back for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.70,0:14:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I can't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.04,0:15:01.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this how you came in last night?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.74,0:15:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the\Npower of the Door-Door Fruit.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.91,0:15:07.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where a normal man sees a wall,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see a prospective entryway.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.98,0:15:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how thick it may be,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.22,0:15:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I simply touch it\Nand it opens for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on. It's not time yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.02,0:15:22.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Relax,\Nit's not a fatal wound,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.16,0:15:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he'll still be able to talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just giving him a taste of what's to\Ncome.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.70,0:15:28.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like an appetizer of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:31.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's more after that,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.52,0:15:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'll be\Nrunning off anywhere
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.18,0:15:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before we get the\Nsignal to finish the job.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.92,0:15:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or, perhaps I should say to\Nserve him the main course.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.89,0:15:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.50,0:15:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's how CP9\Nhandles things, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.57,0:15:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is how we do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.25,0:15:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That poor Straw Hat boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.09,0:16:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He had nothing\Nto do with this, did he?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.27,0:16:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to beat yourself up about\Nit.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.90,0:16:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, you simply told the\Ntruth exactly as you saw it,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.84,0:16:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I was indeed\Nhere last night.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was all part of your plan,\Nwasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.66,0:16:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right again.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're alive for two reasons.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.37,0:16:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, so you could\Ntell your story
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the failed assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Placing a member of\Nthe Straw Hat crew
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.24,0:16:27.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Secondly, we were\Ntrying to ferret out
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.31,0:16:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,an important document.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.71,0:16:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The blueprints of a certain ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.31,0:16:36.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One that has been\Npassed down in secret
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.78,0:16:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from shipwright to chosen\Napprentice for generations.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.61,0:16:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We knew that with your\Nlife clearly in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you would pass\Nthat document on
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.05,0:16:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to someone you\Ntrusted to keep it safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.65,0:16:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You made that choice earlier\Ntonight. Your foreman, Paulie.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.89,0:16:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our associates are with him this very\Nmoment.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.66,0:17:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all going as\Nplanned, isn't it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.20,0:17:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be very damn\Nproud of yourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.50,0:17:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you\Nto see this to its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.74,0:17:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go deal with the riff-raff
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.16,0:17:13.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,standing guard\Noutside the door.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.41,0:17:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When the blueprints are secured,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.04,0:17:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our associates will contact you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.95,0:17:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At that time you will have full\Nclearance to dispose of Iceburg.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.42,0:17:23.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do so at once.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.39,0:17:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure\Nhe dies, without fail.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.76,0:17:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that, the only remaining loose end\Nwill be Paulie.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.43,0:17:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He dies, and the truth of what's happened\Nhere dies with him.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.73,0:17:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The blame will remain\Non the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know he doesn't listen to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.43,0:17:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's crazy, but I thought maybe he'd\Nlisten to his own advice.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.87,0:17:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are talking about Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.97,0:17:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey guys. Do you\Nthink that's Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.94,0:17:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the middle of all that\Ncommotion down at Galley-La?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.21,0:18:00.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what Luffy decided to\Ndo, we still gotta be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.35,0:18:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.35,0:18:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But him rushing in like\Nthat might actually work
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in our favor.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.48,0:18:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you think about\Nthe way he does things,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.39,0:18:09.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is he the kind of guy\Nthat's gonna go in through
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the back or side entrance?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not his style.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.09,0:18:12.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.03,0:18:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm pretty sure\Nby now he's made a go
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.11,0:18:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at barging straight\Nthrough the front door.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.85,0:18:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's safe to\Nassume that right now
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.82,0:18:20.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's running around\Ninside like crazy,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because he has no idea where\Nhe's going, doncha think?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.98,0:18:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.99,0:18:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like him!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! From the\Nshipwrights' point of view,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.93,0:18:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's the leader of the\Ngroup that attacked Iceburg.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.33,0:18:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So if he made it\Nin there by now,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.03,0:18:34.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all of those guys are gonna\Nbe busy trying to catch him!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which would mean the guards\Nhave severely thinned out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:38.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the front door,\Nor at the very least,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're completely distracted!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.46,0:18:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the safest way in right\Nnow is through the front,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:45.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,right behind all the\Nchaos in Luffy's wake!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.49,0:18:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So when he does it, it's completely\Nstupid.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if we do the\Nexact same thing,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's actually a\Nbrilliant plan, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.14,0:18:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, makes sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.30,0:18:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I say that we\Nshould go for it then!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.22,0:18:56.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gate is right up ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.06,0:18:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Ready?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.46,0:18:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's show time!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.03,0:19:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This was a dumb idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.13,0:19:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guh, crap. This sucks!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.06,0:19:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}I wanted to jump right though\Nthe front door like a typhoon.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.24,0:19:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,475)}But I'm totally stuck!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.28,0:19:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta get out.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.05,0:19:41.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta get Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.28,0:19:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NWhat the hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,RAAAAAHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.45,0:20:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need help on the third floor!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.39,0:20:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody come to the\Npresident's room, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.32,0:20:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The guards were wiped out!\NI need backup!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.76,0:20:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What d'you mean,\N"wiped out"?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.79,0:20:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tilestone!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.76,0:20:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku and Lucci should be there!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, come see.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.72,0:20:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,RAHHHH!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.04,0:20:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.47,0:20:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still no word.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.55,0:20:36.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired of dealing with all\Nthese idiots.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.05,0:20:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.02,0:20:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! Bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.92,0:20:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a\Nnoisy one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.82,0:20:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you laid a single\Nfinger on Mr. Iceburg,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tear you limb from limb!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.00,0:20:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Iron Body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.77,0:20:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raaaahh! Raaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.98,0:21:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.45,0:21:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He crushed that giant hammer!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not good!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.79,0:21:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.49,0:21:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get your hands of me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.34,0:21:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.46,0:21:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph!\NAre those muscles just for show?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.23,0:21:19.90,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't move my arm!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.93,0:21:22.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,How is this guy\Nstronger than me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.65,0:21:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's taken out\Nthree foremen all on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.69,0:21:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get\Nreinforcements downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shave!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.75,0:21:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We found them!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They finally showed up!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.96,0:22:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.60,0:22:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That woman is one of them too!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.27,0:22:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.46,0:22:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Luffy isn't here,\Nthen where is he?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.64,0:22:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know, why\Nare you asking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:13.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaa!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.12,0:22:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.56,0:22:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, they've already found us,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.96,0:22:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so there's no point\Nin trying to be sneaky.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.86,0:22:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only thing left to do\Nnow is to go on the offensive!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.50,0:22:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you\Nthink you're doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.80,0:22:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running circles\Naround the building
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.40,0:22:27.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,won't do us any good.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.83,0:22:29.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we want to find Robin,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.31,0:22:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then we're gonna have\Nto force our way through.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.73,0:22:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.40,0:22:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but those are just shipwrights!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.40,0:22:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not the bad guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.85,0:22:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use\Nthe back of my swords!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.58,0:22:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want\Na fight, you got one!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.97,0:22:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– You can still kill people like that, you know!\N– You can still kill people like that, you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.86,0:23:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mwell, what a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all this time,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.82,0:23:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never thought we'd be\Nmeeting here, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.79,0:23:22.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to know you?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.36,0:23:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, last night\Nwas the first time we met.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.76,0:23:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But for a long time\NI've wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.77,0:23:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I even put your wanted\Nposter up in my room,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I'd never forget.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.84,0:23:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall I give you an autograph,\Nthen?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.41,0:23:40.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you sign it in blood!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.52,0:23:43.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanted to kill me?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.36,0:23:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. Before\Nyou destroy the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me... Why are you\Nlooking for the Poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.50,0:23:54.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must know the risk.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.87,0:23:56.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For as long as\Nanyone can remember,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.51,0:23:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the World Government has\Nmade it a serious crime
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.15,0:24:01.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to research them.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.18,0:24:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is that knowledge so important?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.26,0:24:07.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they're so bad, then why do you know\Nabout them?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.63,0:24:11.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knowing that the Poneglyphs\Nexist is hardly a crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.26,0:24:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But deciphering\Nthem is another matter
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.90,0:24:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you're the only person in\Nthe world who's capable of that.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.90,0:24:19.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why the World Government
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.30,0:24:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,put such a large\Nbounty on your head.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.80,0:24:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even though you were only\N8 years old at the time.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.88,0:24:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They fear what\Nyou're capable of.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.31,0:24:29.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because you\Nalone have the power
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.81,0:24:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to revive the ancient weapons.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.65,0:24:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you already know.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.82,0:24:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I never\Nwould've thought
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.29,0:24:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that CP9 was actually real.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.86,0:24:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if that's the\Ncase, that means
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.53,0:24:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you've already\Nleft the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.30,0:24:50.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you're helping the\NWorld Government now.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.87,0:24:52.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A strange choice for a woman
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.50,0:24:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,whose been on their most\Nwanted list for 20 years,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.38,0:24:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but, mwell, I suppose\Nthat's not my concern.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.25,0:25:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you decipher the Poneglyphs
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.28,0:25:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and rebuild one of the\Nweapons it doesn't matter
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.71,0:25:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if the person who uses\Nit's "good" or "evil."
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.49,0:25:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all the same in the end.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.78,0:25:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A weapon can never be used to bring peace\Nto this world.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.20,0:25:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All it can bring is destruction.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.40,0:25:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've buried the evils of\Nthe past, now let them lie.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.61,0:25:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may be right\Nand I don't disagree.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.98,0:25:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you don't know why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.61,0:25:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have no right to tell\Nme what I'm allowed to do
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.35,0:25:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or not do with my research
Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.92,0:25:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or what knowledge\NI can or cannot learn.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.45,0:25:40.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mwell, I see what you mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.72,0:25:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the truth is we might have\Nmore in common than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.02,0:25:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you didn't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.29,0:25:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I possess the blueprints
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.46,0:25:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for the ancient\Nweapon known as Pluton.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.59,0:25:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then they still exist?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.63,0:25:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pluton is the\Nname of a battleship built
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.70,0:25:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on this island many\Nyears in the past.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.40,0:26:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The shipwrights who\Ncreated the weapon
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.87,0:26:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,passed on the blueprints as\Na sort of insurance policy.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.04,0:26:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They feared that another\Nbattleship of equal power
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.54,0:26:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would be necessary if Pluton\Never fell into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.96,0:26:12.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, the ship was lost
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.49,0:26:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to history before\Nthat could happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.13,0:26:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now the government\Nwants to revive that power,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.40,0:26:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when there's no force\Nstrong enough to oppose it.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.17,0:26:23.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A part of me hopes that\Nyou didn't know that
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.94,0:26:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when you agreed\Nto help them out
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.94,0:26:27.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't\Nreally matter now.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.93,0:26:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A man named Tom entrusted those blueprints\Nto me.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.37,0:26:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he also told me\Nabout a young girl
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.04,0:26:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who was the sole survivor of\Nthe Ohara incident 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.61,0:26:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said despite her age,\Nshe was still dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.01,0:26:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because she had\Nthe same ideology
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.88,0:26:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as the devils from Ohara.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.62,0:26:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In honor of Tom and\Nthe other shipwrights,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.70,0:26:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's my responsibility\Nto stop you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.64,0:26:50.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, now that\Nthe government knows
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.09,0:26:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that the blueprints exist the\Nlogical solution would be
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.36,0:26:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to burn them and\Nbe done with this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.49,0:26:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I can't do that because\Nas long as you're alive,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.10,0:27:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's a chance that the\Nweapon could be rebuilt!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.50,0:27:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that all you\Nwant to say before you die?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.85,0:27:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and with all due respect,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.85,0:27:22.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even if you had killed me,\Nnothing would've changed.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.02,0:27:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government doesn't need me\Nto steal the blueprints from you
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.99,0:27:28.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure they've already\Naccomplished that anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.11,0:27:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mwell, let's not get\Nahead of ourselves here.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.78,0:27:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who've fallen for my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.77,0:27:56.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.47,0:27:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.93,0:28:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never get out of there!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.28,0:28:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, that was terrible!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.05,0:28:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's get\Nit right this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.41,0:28:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll find Robin for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.28,0:28:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.59,0:28:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're\Nno match for our martial arts.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.88,0:28:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now stop resisting\Nand hand us the document
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.43,0:28:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before you soil\Nit with your blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.15,0:28:53.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.63,0:28:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really thought\NI could beat them...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.44,0:29:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shoulda known better.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.00,0:29:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This was all my idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.01,0:29:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg didn't\Ntell me to fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.84,0:29:17.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He told me to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.95,0:29:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To run and leave the blueprints behind.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.13,0:29:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya know why?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.09,0:29:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause those are\Nnothing but fakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.46,0:29:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.54,0:29:31.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.65,0:29:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can't be serious.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.35,0:29:36.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.14,0:29:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.54,0:29:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but this means your\Nplan's a bust, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.65,0:29:44.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad. Sucks to be you.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.55,0:29:47.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Funny thing is\NI don't even know
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.09,0:29:50.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what you bastards were\Nlooking for in the first place.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.59,0:29:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you think you've outwitted CP9,\Nyou're wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:54.16,0:29:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're merely delaying the inevitable.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.53,0:30:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, even\Nthough you're only a decoy.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.45,0:30:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that you know the truth,\Nwe can't let you live.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.55,0:30:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I got stuck again!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.06,0:30:22.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid walls getting\Nin my way all the time!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.03,0:30:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate 'em, I hate 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.18,0:30:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.37,0:30:28.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the rope guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.34,0:30:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on in here?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.34,0:30:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you okay?\NYou're covered in blood!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.38,0:30:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure did surprise me!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.18,0:30:36.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.01,0:30:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least I'm not crashing through walls.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.48,0:30:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.26,0:30:44.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How kind of you to come here\Nto take blame for the crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.43,0:30:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! I get it! You guys in\Nthe masks must be the ones
Dialogue: 50,0:30:48.27,0:30:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that're forcing Robin to\Ndo all this bad stuff, huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.14,0:30:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You give her back, you bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.70,0:30:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I wasn't stuck right now, you'd be in\Nbig trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.13,0:30:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tempest Kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.37,0:30:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uhn?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:12.42,0:31:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He cut right through the wall!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.35,0:31:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, behind you!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:29.44,0:31:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are these...?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.25,0:31:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency situation.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.35,0:31:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to deal with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.33,0:31:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:37.56,0:31:39.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Restrain Paulie too.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.36,0:31:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's given us enough\Ntrouble already.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.42,0:31:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.19,0:31:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hggh... Hgggh... Haaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.74,0:31:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puru-puru. Puru-puru.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.27,0:31:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.38,0:32:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's me.\NWe've hit a snag in the plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.35,0:32:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone head to the bedroom immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:03.75,0:32:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't shoot Iceburg yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:06.20,0:32:10.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You understand?\NI absolutely need him alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:14.07,0:32:15.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This has been a delight,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.21,0:32:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid our time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.08,0:32:18.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.34,0:32:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see, I have\Na pressing matter to attend to.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:20.25,0:32:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running away, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.03,0:32:23.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:30.15,0:32:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just\Nfinishing you quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.45,0:32:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.62,0:32:34.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.66,0:32:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.39,0:32:40.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's flying again!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.40,0:32:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:46.76,0:32:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kidding? This is nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.44,0:32:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:51.34,0:32:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why did you come\Nhere in the first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:53.76,0:32:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone still thinks you're\Nthe ones who attacked Iceburg.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.39,0:32:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, by the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.53,0:33:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I realize I mighta\Njumped the gun a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:01.70,0:33:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No big deal.\NWe are pirates, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:05.17,0:33:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the point\Nis those weird guys
Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.60,0:33:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the masks took\None of our crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:09.96,0:33:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we're here to get her back.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.34,0:33:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:19.97,0:33:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you're good at fighting, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:22.47,0:33:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:24.10,0:33:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you can beat those guys, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:26.08,0:33:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:29.30,0:33:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:30.50,0:33:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can do this thing together.\N'Cause I'm ready to fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:33.10,0:33:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:33.80,0:33:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:34.98,0:33:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean you think\NI'm just gonna let
Dialogue: 50,0:33:36.71,0:33:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,some weirdoes\Nwaltz in outta nowhere,
Dialogue: 50,0:33:38.18,0:33:40.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kick my ass and\Nthen kill Iceburg?!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:40.78,0:33:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:42.04,0:33:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do those punks,\Nthink they are, anyway?!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:44.02,0:33:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To hell with all this secret agent crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:49.16,0:33:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg is...
Dialogue: 50,0:33:51.99,0:33:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...more than just my boss.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:54.13,0:33:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's my teacher.\NHe made me a shipwright.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:56.66,0:33:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't let him die.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:58.53,0:33:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But look at you, you're a mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:59.98,0:34:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm ready\Nto fight those bastards,
Dialogue: 50,0:34:02.09,0:34:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm not giving up!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:03.29,0:34:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to me\Nas long as I can save Iceburg!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:08.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Auugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:08.99,0:34:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I can't even move,
Dialogue: 50,0:34:09.92,0:34:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,cause I'm stuck to\Nthe floor! This sucks!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:14.82,0:34:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I know! This sucks!\NAuuugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.12,0:34:22.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Auuugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.43,0:34:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Auugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:42.62,0:34:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go home! I have nothing\Nto give you people!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:48.09,0:34:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we have\Na problem, don't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:57.46,0:35:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does one say to\Na man who's marked for death?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:03.03,0:35:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, let me be frank.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:05.54,0:35:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:12.60,0:35:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:14.58,0:35:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.04,0:35:18.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should've handed\Nover the blueprints
Dialogue: 50,0:35:21.44,0:35:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when the government\Nasked nicely.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:24.44,0:35:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:26.54,0:35:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pity. I was hoping\Nwe could walk away
Dialogue: 50,0:35:29.11,0:35:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from this story without\Nresorting to violence.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:33.41,0:35:34.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:34.88,0:35:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a shame you're as hard-headed as your\Nmaster.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:38.12,0:35:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno, from the bar.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:41.08,0:35:46.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means you've been with\Nthe government all this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:46.65,0:35:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.75,0:35:48.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Needless to say,
Dialogue: 50,0:35:48.79,0:35:52.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,going undercover was\Nlike second-nature to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:52.76,0:35:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now since everyone's\Nbeing so honest
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.56,0:35:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with each other,\Nlet's try this again.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:59.17,0:36:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play games.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:01.80,0:36:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me before someone\Nelse gets hurt. Where is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:07.11,0:36:11.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are the blueprints for the ancient\Nweapon Pluton?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=4}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
